   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The «stare + gerund» periphrasis",
     "texto": [
      "The verb **stare** is conjugated in the present (**sto, stai, sta, stiamo, state, stanno**) followed directly by the **gerund**: **Sto studiando** (I'm studying); **Cosa stai facendo?** (what are you doing?); **I ragazzi stanno dormendo** (the boys are sleeping)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Simple present versus stare + gerund",
     "texto": [
      "The present indicative describes habits, general facts or routines: **Di solito cucino a casa** (I usually cook at home).",
      "By contrast, *stare + gerund* focuses on the action in its strict course over time: **In questo momento sto cucinando** (at this moment I'm cooking)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
